+# bubble_sort
+
+Educational bubble sort implementation.
+
+## API
+
+```python
+from bubble_sort import bubble_sort, bubble_sorted
+
+values = [3, 1, 2]
+bubble_sort(values)
+print(values)  # [1, 2, 3]
+
+print(bubble_sorted([3, 1, 2], reverse=True))  # [3, 2, 1]
+```
+
+## CLI
+
+```bash
+python -m bubble_sort 3 1 2
+python -m bubble_sort 3 1 2 --reverse
+python -m bubble_sort a bb c --type str
+```
+
